Reused components
-----------------

- src/protocol/message.ts and src/protocol/rendezvous.ts are derived from the
  RustDesk web client v1 (rustdesk/rustdesk-web, branch rustdesk-web-v1,
  commit 8a9af6ecdd511fa97e89844e27c5d2dae53acd77), part of the RustDesk
  project (https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk). AGPL-3.0-or-later; see
  src/protocol/NOTICE.md for provenance and modifications.
- src/input/keymaps.ts transcribes the keyboard position-keycode tables from
  the RustDesk web client v2 (rustdesk/rustdesk-web, branch rustdesk-web-v2,
  commit 10a477b67f7411da21fe88f4809eab7cb81e6102). AGPL-3.0-or-later; see
  src/input/NOTICE.md for provenance and modifications.
- assets/ogv/ contains ogv.js 1.8.6 decoder assets. See assets/ogv/COPYING,
  assets/ogv/LICENSE-vpx.txt and assets/ogv/PATENTS-vpx.txt.
- npm dependencies retain their own licenses; see each package's LICENSE.
